     Formally verified clinical rules encoding ACORN 2023 standards.
     These files are maintained in a separate private repository.

  2. Verification pipeline scripts (verify/*.py)
     4C verification framework implementation.

  3. Commercial license management system

These components may not be used, copied, modified, or distributed
without a separate written license agreement from NingboTech University.

================================================================
CLINICAL DISCLAIMER
================================================================

NurseWiki Pro is a CLINICAL DECISION SUPPORT TOOL only.
It is NOT a substitute for:
  - Professional clinical judgement
  - Institutional policies and procedures
  - Direct clinical supervision
  - Current AHPRA registration requirements

All users must hold current registration with the Australian Health
Practitioner Regulation Agency (AHPRA) or equivalent authority,
and must comply with their employing facility's policies.

The authors and NingboTech University accept no liability for
clinical decisions made on the basis of content in this knowledge base.

Always verify clinical information against current ACORN standards
and your institution's approved guidelines.

